---
// Technical architecture and engineering breakdown in pure Vercel light design style
---

<section id="features" class="py-16 md:py-24 border-t border-[#ebebeb] bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
      <span class="eyebrow text-[#0070f3] block mb-2">Features</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] mb-4">
        Simple, powerful voice tools.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
        Create natural speech, realistic voiceovers, and voice clones in seconds.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4-Card Grid (Clean hairline cards, no pills) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="vercel-card rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#f2f2f2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#171717] mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z" />
            <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2" />
            <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="22" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-[#8f8f8f]">Voice Quality</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717]">Natural Human Tone</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
          Clear, lifelike speech with natural pacing and emotion. Sounds like a real person, not a robot.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="vercel-card rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#f2f2f2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#171717] mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="m12 3-1.912 5.813a2 2 0 0 1-1.275 1.275L3 12l5.813 1.912a2 2 0 0 1 1.275 1.275L12 21l1.912-5.813a2 2 0 0 1 1.275-1.275L21 12l-5.813-1.912a2 2 0 0 1-1.275-1.275L12 3Z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-[#8f8f8f]">Voice Cloning</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717]">Clone Any Voice</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
          Record or upload a 5-second audio sample to generate speech in that exact voice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="vercel-card rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#f2f2f2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#171717] mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
            <path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20" />
            <path d="M2 12h20" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-[#8f8f8f]">Languages</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717]">5 Languages</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
          Create speech in English, Spanish, German, Italian, and Portuguese with authentic accents.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="vercel-card rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#f2f2f2] flex items-center justify-center text-[#171717] mb-4">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="eyebrow text-[#8f8f8f]">Pricing</span>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#171717]">100% Free & Unlimited</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
          No signups, no credit limits, and no paid tiers. Generate as much audio as you need.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
